OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of jailed
OL,4,Asurgeon's patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA criminal investigation has begun into
OL,7,Fthe death of a former patient of the
OL,8,Fjailed breast surgeon Ian Paterson.
OL,10,FThe deaths of 73 of his patients are
OL,11,Fbeing investigated at inquests to
OL,12,Fdetermine whether or not they died an
OL,13,Funnatural death as a result of his care
OL,14,Fand treatment.
OL,16,FCoroner Judge Richard Foster has
OL,17,Freferred the case of Joan Green to West
OL,18,FMidlands Police.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
