OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of jailed
OL,4,Asurgeon's patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson said the force
OL,7,Fhad received information from the
OL,8,Fcoroner in August and had now "advised
OL,9,FHM Coroner that we have commenced a
OL,10,Fcriminal investigation to establish
OL,11,Fmore details around the circumstances
OL,12,Fof the death of Joan Green".
